Error [jet.InvalidScopedPolicy]: `#Inline: …` cannot attach at the Block site
  --> tests/ui/marker_inbody/wrong_site_block_line.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |         #Inline: true
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `#X: value` line is a marker of the declaration whose body holds it directly; a nested block or a lambda body is not a declaration
 Fix: Move the line directly into the function's body, or write `#Inline` above the declaration
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0355
